{"data":[{"type":"inAppPurchases","id":"6809078171","attributes":{"name":"Remove Ads","productId":"com.hwechul.spinhop.remove_ads","inAppPurchaseType":"NON_CONSUMABLE","state":"APPROVED","reviewNote":"No sign-in required. Open SpinHop, tap Shop on Home, and scroll to THE GOOD STUFF. Remove Ads is a one-time nonconsumable (com.hwechul.spinhop.remove_ads) that disables automatic interstitial ads between runs. Optional rewarded ads for a continuation or bonus coins remain available only when the player chooses them. No gameplay physics or scores are improved by this purchase. After a verified StoreKit purchase, ad removal persists via the Apple entitlement. Restore purchases is available in Shop and Settings. Please use an App Store sandbox account to test. Supporter Pack is an alternative that includes this benefit; owning Supporter Pack prevents redundant Remove Ads purchases. The review screenshot shows the actual app shop with localized StoreKit test-session prices."},"relationships":{"inAppPurchaseLocalizations":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v2/inAppPurchases/6809078171/relationships/inAppPurchaseLocalizations","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v2/inAppPurchases/6809078171/inAppPurchaseLocalizations"}},"pricePoints":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v2/inAppPurchases/6809078171/relationships/pricePoints","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v2/inAppPurchases/6809078171/pricePoints"}},"content":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v2/inAppPurchases/6809078171/relationships/content","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v2/inAppPurchases/6809078171/content"}},"appStoreReviewScreenshot":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v2/inAppPurchases/6809078171/relationships/appStoreReviewScreenshot","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v2/inAppPurchases/6809078171/appStoreReviewScreenshot"}},"promotedPurchase":{"links":{"self":"https://api.ap